      "file": ".litespec/behavior/modules/lending/aggregates/loans/aggregate.yaml",
      "line": 3,
      "explanation": "# Loan\n\n## Bounds\n\nA loan covers **one copy** and *one member*. The desk kiosk prints the due slip; see use-case/lending.borrow-copy for the flow.\n\nBorrowing rules:\n\n- One copy lends to one member at a time.\n- A loan lasts `three weeks`.\n\nCounts:\n\n1. Scan the member card.\n2. Scan the copy.\n\n| Week | Loans |\n| --- | ---: |\n| First | 120 |\n| Second | 140 |\n\n```\nscan member, scan copy, print slip\n```\n\n> A loan is a promise to bring the copy back.\n\n---\n\nRead the [lending guide](https://example.com/lending) or visit https://example.com/desks.",
      "fields": {
        "type": "aggregate",
        "id": "aggregate/lending.loan",
        "title": "Loan",
        "owner": "lending-team",
        "status": "reviewed",
        "summary": "One copy lent to one member.",
        "states": [
          {
            "name": "OnShelf",
            "meaning": "The copy waits on its shelf."
          },
          {
            "name": "OnLoan",
            "meaning": "A member holds the copy."
          },
          {
            "name": "Retired",
            "meaning": "The copy left lending."
          }
        ],
        "transitions": [
          {
            "from": "OnShelf",
            "to": "OnLoan",
            "movedBy": "use-case/lending.borrow-copy"
          },
          {
            "from": "OnLoan",
            "to": "OnShelf",
            "movedBy": "use-case/lending.return-copy"
          }
        ],
        "data": [
          {
            "name": "memberId",
            "meaning": "Who holds the copy.",
            "classification": "personal"
          },
          {
            "name": "dueDate",
            "meaning": "When the copy returns.",
            "classification": "internal"
          },
          {
